# Mustache Lint baseline
#
# This file lists the Mustache Lint messages which are accepted for Boost Union's own templates.
# It is processed by the Mustache Lint step of the moodle-an-hochschulen/moodle-workflows Moodle Plugin CI workflow.
# Messages of templates which are copied from upstream are not listed here, they are accepted via the .upstream files instead.
#
# Format: One message per line as "<template path>: <message>", where the message is normalized
# (without the line number and without the HTML extract in parentheses) as printed in the workflow log.
# Lines starting with # and empty lines are ignored.

